OL,3,GNEWSAMatch commemorates World War One
OL,4,AChristmas truce
OL,5,
OL,6,FA German football team is visiting
OL,7,FNottinghamshire for the first time to
OL,8,Fcommemorate the World War One Christmas
OL,9,Ftruce.
OL,11,FOn Christmas Day 1914, British and
OL,12,FGerman troops at several locations in
OL,13,FBelgium stopped fighting and came out
OL,14,Fof their trenches to meet each other.
OL,16,FA soldier from Newark, William
OL,17,FSetchfield, was present at one near the
OL,18,Fvillage of Messines and may even have
OL,19,Fprovided the football which was used
OL,20,Fduring the truce.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
