OL,3,GNEWSAMatch commemorates World War One
OL,4,AChristmas truce
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the centenary of the event, a team
OL,7,Ffrom Newark played a side from its twin
OL,8,Ftown of Emmendingen at the site of the
OL,9,Ffront lines. Now, the two sides will
OL,10,Fmeet again on Saturday in what is being
OL,11,Fbilled as a Peace Match.
